  "label": "Racial Stereotype: Welfare Dependency Tropes",
  "description": "This stereotype portrays Black individuals as inherently dependent on welfare. In this meme, the man’s formal attire and serious expression contrast with the absurd accusation of farting, which can be interpreted as a mockery of his perceived 'unworthy' or 'unproductive' qualities. The meme relies on the viewer’s implicit understanding of this stereotype to generate its humor, which is rooted in racial prejudice.",
